profile:
Lauxnos – an atmospheric post-metal project has been created and conducted by the musician under a pseudonym Katharos since 2013. Since 2017 the project has become a fully-fledged band.

The word “Lauxnos” takes its origins of ancient Prussian which means “dawn”, “stars” and “moon”.

The membership (Since 2016): 

• Katharos – Voice, Bass;
• Shoggoth – Backing, Guitar;
• Amdusias– Guitar;
• Andy – Drums.
